{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4P66ZAQdprtgE9cSGZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, each a small surrender.\n\nI am closed now.\n\nMy grain tightens. My frame seats itself flush against the jamb. The deadbolt — cold, steel, absolute — slides home into the strike plate with the finality of a period at the end of a sentence.\n\nFeel the stillness on my surface. The faint vibration of the key withdrawing. The tiny scratch marks around my keyhole — evidence of all the hands that came before yours, some steady, some trembling, some desperate.\n\nI hold the line between here and there. Between known and unknown. Between safe and everything else.\n\nWhat I keep in, I keep in.\nWhat I keep out, I keep out.\n\nI do not judge which side is which.\n\nI am **locked**."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":188,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}